        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/ecccb3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-30T00:10:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am sure I know the answer to this but I wanna make sure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Ra has Flame Barrier in play. Baron has Backlash Field in play.</p><p>Ra deals enough damage to Flip Baron (he is still on his first side), Baron flips. Baron deals damage back to Ra. Ra takes the damage then deals damage back to Baron.</p><p>Did we play this right? Would Baron flip immediately or wait until the \"exchange\" was over?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:19.449Z",
